        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5 The Communications Workers of America (CWA) recognizes that each Union Local accepts the responsibility for keeping the CWA National Office apprised of the deduction cards that they receive in accordance with this memorandum in order for the National Office to be able to apportion the Local's share of the dues to the appropriate Local.",
